// 068 — for-each / range loop
// AiLang's grammar reserves `ForEvery <var> in <collection>` for
// collection iteration (arrays, maps — see Cat 6+). There's no numeric
// Range(…) helper yet, so for a counted range the idiomatic form is
// still WhileLoop with an index. When the array demos land in
// Cat 6 we'll show ForEvery over a real collection.
SubRoutine.Main {
    n = 1
    WhileLoop LessEqual(n, 5) {
        PrintMessage("n = ")
        PrintNumber(n)
        PrintMessage("\n")
        n = Add(n, 1)
    }
}
RunTask(Main)
